    "regime_notes": "Positive across all available regimes: 2026-2028 IC 0.052630/ICIR 0.153244; 2029-2030 0.135678/0.430423; 2031-2032-02-19 0.246837/0.537960. Earlier dates lacked sufficient downside-volatility history under the minimum-period rule. Small cross-asset universe warrants conservative inference.",
